Q: Remove selected value shadcn A: <p>To prevent the Radix trigger from opening, you should call <a href="https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/API/Event/stopPropagation" rel="nofollow noreferrer">e.stopPropagation()</a> in the <a href="https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/API/Element/pointerdown_event" rel="nofollow noreferrer">onPointerDown</a> handler.</p>
<pre class="lang-js prettyprint-override"><code>&lt;X
  onClick={(e) =&gt; {
    e.stopPropagation();
    onChange?.('');
  }}
  onPointerDown={(e) =&gt; {
    e.stopPropagation();
  }}
/&gt;
</code></pre>
<p>The relationship between a button and selected content in the HTML standard is as follows:</p>
<blockquote>
<p>Phrasing content, but there must be no interactive content descendant and no descendant with the tabindex attribute specified. If the element is the first child of a select element, then it may also have one descendant selectedcontent element.<br />
<a href="https://html.spec.whatwg.org/multipage/form-elements.html#the-button-element" rel="nofollow noreferrer">https://html.spec.whatwg.org/multipage/form-elements.html#the-button-element</a></p>
</blockquote>
<blockquote>
<p>Adheres to the <a href="https://www.w3.org/WAI/ARIA/apg/patterns/listbox" rel="nofollow noreferrer">ListBox WAI-ARIA design pattern</a>.</p>
<p>See the W3C <a href="https://www.w3.org/TR/wai-aria-practices/examples/combobox/combobox-select-only.html" rel="nofollow noreferrer">Select-Only Combobox</a> example for more information.</p>
<p><a href="https://www.radix-ui.com/primitives/docs/components/select#accessibility" rel="nofollow noreferrer">https://www.radix-ui.com/primitives/docs/components/select#accessibility</a></p>
</blockquote>
<p>Alternative topic of discussion:<br />
<a href="https://github.com/radix-ui/primitives/issues/3099" rel="nofollow noreferrer">https://github.com/radix-ui/primitives/issues/3099</a></p>

Q: CommonJS package in Angular Vitest test - &quot;requested module is a CommonJS module...&quot; A: <p>I got it running by providing a custom Vitest configuration (<a href="https://angular.dev/guide/testing/migrating-to-vitest#custom-vitest-configuration" rel="nofollow noreferrer">https://angular.dev/guide/testing/migrating-to-vitest#custom-vitest-configuration</a>), which ensures that the specified CommonJS modules (my library) is processed inline:</p>
<p>vitest.config.ts:</p>
<pre><code>export default defineConfig({
  test: {
    server: {
      deps: {
        inline: [/@my-lib/]
      }
    }
  }
});
</code></pre>
<p>angular.json:</p>
<pre><code>&quot;test&quot;: {
  &quot;builder&quot;: &quot;@angular/build:unit-test&quot;,
  &quot;options&quot;: {
    &quot;runnerConfig&quot;: &quot;vitest.config.ts&quot;
  }
},
</code></pre>
<p>Voilà, the tests run!</p>
<p>Source for the &quot;test.server.deps.inline&quot; Vitest configuration option: <a href="https://www.syncfusion.com/forums/188985/vitest-not-working?reply=zwfEke" rel="nofollow noreferrer">https://www.syncfusion.com/forums/188985/vitest-not-working?reply=zwfEke</a>, <a href="https://github.com/vitest-dev/vitest/issues/6875" rel="nofollow noreferrer">https://github.com/vitest-dev/vitest/issues/6875</a></p>
